# Keep the Docker build context small and free of secrets.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/App_Data/
**/TestResults/
**/test-results/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/.DS_Store

.git/
.github/
.claude/
docs/
deploy/
tests/

# Secrets never go into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/secrets.json
